  <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
    <name>PagesRecounts</name>
    <id>312</id>
    <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
      <name>PageThereAreRecounts</name>
      <id>314</id>
      <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
        <name>DecorationThereAreRecalculations</name>
        <id>67</id>
        <title>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>There are &lt;link ListOfRecalculationsOnlyOutstanding>inventory counts&lt;/> results of which are not entered yet (they are not posted in the &quot;Completed&quot; status).</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>&lt;link ListOfRecalculationsOnlyOutstanding>شمارش‌های موجودی&lt;/> وجود دارند که نتایج آن‌ها هنوز وارد نشده است (در وضعیت &quot;تکمیل‌شده&quot; ثبت قطعی نشده‌اند).</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>Есть &lt;link ListOfRecalculationsOnlyOutstanding>пересчеты товаров&lt;/>, по которым еще не завершено внесение результатов (они не проведены в статусе &quot;Выполнено&quot;).</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>Sonuçlarının &lt;link ListOfRecalculationsOnlyOutstanding>girişinin tamamlanmadığı&lt;/> (&quot;Tamamlandı&quot; durumunda kaydedilmemiş) ürünlerin stok sayımı mevcut.</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>Có chứng từ &lt;link ListOfRecalculationsOnlyOutstanding>kiểm đếm hàng hóa&lt;/> mà vẫn chưa nhập xong kết quả (chứng từ chưa kết chuyển với trạng thái &quot;Đã thực hiện&quot;).</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>There are &lt;link ListOfRecalculationsOnlyOutstanding>inventory counts&lt;/> results of which are not entered yet (they are not posted in the &quot;Completed&quot; status).</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>There are &lt;link ListOfRecalculationsOnlyOutstanding>inventory counts&lt;/> results of which are not entered yet (they are not posted in the &quot;Completed&quot; status).</value>
        </title>
        <visible>true</visible>
        <enabled>true</enabled>
        <userVisible>
          <common>true</common>
        </userVisible>
        <extendedTooltip>
          <name>DecorationThereAreRecalculationsExtendedTooltip</name>
          <id>94</id>
          <type>Label</type>
